/*
 * ===== styles.tcss — DNALLM-Mark console styles (Phase 8, 08-02) =====
 *
 * Minimal by design: the skeleton app carries no styled widgets yet; screen
 * rules land with the screens (08-03+).
 *
 * Contract (08-UI-SPEC Color, approved 2026-10-11): semantic Textual theme
 * tokens ONLY — $background, $surface, $panel, $boost, $accent, $success,
 * $warning, $error, $text-muted — which adapt to light/dark/NO_COLOR
 * automatically. Hardcoded hex is forbidden here; the single permitted hex
 * site is the optional `dnallmmark` custom theme definition (brand teal,
 * not landed yet). Every color-coded state carries a distinct glyph first
 * (glyph+color redundancy) so the UI stays legible under NO_COLOR.
 */
